       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     SDCKINFO.
       AUTHOR.         ANNETTE M. KRAUSS.
       INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   JUNE 9, 1987.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *REMARKS.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *D   SDCKINFO     DOCK INFORMATION SUBPROGRAM                *
      *                                                            *
      *D    THIS PROGRAM IS USED TO ENTER THE ALLOWABLE            *
      *D    OVERSHIPMENT VALUES FOR DOCK RECEIPTS AND THE RAW      *
      *D    MATERIAL GROUP DESIGNATORS.                            *
      *D                                                           *
      **************************************************************
      *C
      *C   6/23/95     JEFF BUNGO
      *C       ADDED FLAGS FOR BATCH RECEIVING (KELLY ONLY).  ONE
      *C       FLAG TO INDICATE IF CSIS ONLINE RECEIVING SHOULD
      *C       BE LOCKED.  A SECOND FLAG TO INDICATE IF A REPORT
      *C       OF SUCCESSFUL RECEIPTS IS PRINTED.
      *C
      *C   6/6/96      JEFF BUNGO
      *C       ADDED NEW QUESTION ABOUT PRINTING RECEIVING SLIPS
      *C       USING SPECIAL PRINTING (COMPRESSED, EXPANDED, ETC.)
      *C       A Y/N QUESTION.
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                   ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZPLTSTUP-SI
                   ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                   ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                   FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                   CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
            SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                   ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                   RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                       PIC X(2000).
       FD  MPLTINFO-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1                 PIC X VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2                 PIC X VALUE SPACE.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **              D A T A    B A S E    A R E A              **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       COPY MPLT0    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTOVSH IN COPYLIB.
0992CK*COPY MCLASS   IN COPYLIB.
       01  MPLTINFO-ARG                    PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **              V I E W    W O R K    A R E A              **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT                    PIC X(64)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD                     PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD
                                           PIC Z(11)9.
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **                 TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                  **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       01  DOCK-INFO.
           05  OVERSHIPMENT-VALUES.
               10  CODED-VALUE           PIC 9(2).
               10  NCODED-VALUE          PIC 9(2).
               10  CODED-RM-VALUE        PIC 9(2).
           05  RM-MAJOR-GROUP.
               10  RM-GROUP-X
                   OCCURS 6 TIMES        PIC X(2).
           05  RM-GROUP-AUTO-STORED.
               10  RM-AUTO-STORED
                   OCCURS 4 TIMES        PIC X(1).
      *            15  RM-AS-GROUP       PIC X(2).
      *            15  RM-AS-SW          PIC X(1).
           05  TALLY-IND                 PIC X(1).
           05  TALLY-CLASS               PIC X(3).
           05  BATCH-DOCK-INFO.
               10  LOCK-ONLINE-DOCK      PIC X(1).
               10  PRINT-BATCH-REPORT    PIC X(1).
           05  DOCK-SPECIAL-PRINT        PIC X(1).
           05  DOCK-MSGLINE              PIC X(79).
           05  CMDLINE                   PIC X(79).
           05  ERR-MSGLINE               PIC X(79).

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **        S U B P R O G R A M   A R E A S                  **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDATA   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **               LINKAGE   SECTION                         **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  BASE                          PIC X(10).

       COPY VCOMLINK IN COPYLIB.

       COPY LANGSUB IN COPYLIB.


      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE,
                                VIEW-COMAREA,
                                LANGUAGE-PARMS.


       1-START.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O.
           GOBACK.

      ******************************************************
      **                 BLOWUP ROUTINE                   **
      ******************************************************
       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *                  6 - M A I N                   *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************
       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "SDCKINFO" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           MOVE "DOCKINFO" TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       6-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES TO DOCK-INFO.
           PERFORM 61-READ-MPLTINFO.

      ***  INPUT DATA ABOVE AND PRESS 'ENTER'  ***
           MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM.
           MOVE  20 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DOCK-MSGLINE.

       6-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE DOCK-INFO   TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO DOCK-INFO.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERR-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 6-SHOW-FORM.

       6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "OVSH"         TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE CODED-VALUE    TO MPLTINFO-CODED-OVSH-VALUE.
           MOVE NCODED-VALUE   TO MPLTINFO-NCODED-OVSH-VALUE.
           MOVE CODED-RM-VALUE TO MPLTINFO-CODED-RM-OVSH-VALUE.
           MOVE RM-MAJOR-GROUP TO MPLTINFO-RM-MAJOR-GROUP.
           MOVE "26"           TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (1).
           MOVE RM-AUTO-STORED (1)   TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (1).
           MOVE "27"           TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (2).
           MOVE RM-AUTO-STORED (2)   TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (2).
           MOVE "28"           TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (3).
           MOVE RM-AUTO-STORED (3)   TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (3).
           MOVE "29"           TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (4).
           MOVE RM-AUTO-STORED (4)   TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (4).
           IF TALLY-IND = "N"
               MOVE "XXX"       TO MPLTINFO-TALLY-CLASS
           ELSE
               MOVE TALLY-CLASS TO MPLTINFO-TALLY-CLASS.
           MOVE LOCK-ONLINE-DOCK TO MPLTINFO-BATCH-ONLINE-LOCK.
           MOVE PRINT-BATCH-REPORT TO MPLTINFO-BATCH-REPORT.
           MOVE DOCK-SPECIAL-PRINT TO MPLTINFO-DOCK-SPECIAL-PRINT.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.
       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       61-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "OVSH" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES          TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "OVSH"          TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "10"            TO MPLTINFO-CODED-OVSH-VALUE
               MOVE "10"            TO MPLTINFO-NCODED-OVSH-VALUE
               MOVE "30"            TO MPLTINFO-CODED-RM-OVSH-VALUE
               MOVE "23262750    "  TO MPLTINFO-RM-MAJOR-GROUP
               MOVE "26"            TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (1)
               MOVE "N"             TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (1)
               MOVE "27"            TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (2)
               MOVE "N"             TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (2)
               MOVE "28"            TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (3)
               MOVE "N"             TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (3)
               MOVE "29"            TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (4)
               MOVE "N"             TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (4)
               MOVE "N"             TO MPLTINFO-BATCH-ONLINE-LOCK
               MOVE "N"             TO MPLTINFO-BATCH-REPORT
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-CODED-OVSH-VALUE    TO CODED-VALUE.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-NCODED-OVSH-VALUE   TO NCODED-VALUE.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-CODED-RM-OVSH-VALUE TO CODED-RM-VALUE.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-RM-MAJOR-GROUP      TO RM-MAJOR-GROUP.
      *--------------  MPLTINFO-RM-STORED ADDED TO KEY 'OVSH' FOR B 0300
      *--------------  CSIS/MMIS RELEASE.
           IF MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (1) = "Y" OR "N"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (1)    TO RM-AUTO-STORED (1)
               MOVE MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (2)    TO RM-AUTO-STORED (2)
               MOVE MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (3)    TO RM-AUTO-STORED (3)
               MOVE MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (4)    TO RM-AUTO-STORED (4)
           ELSE
      *--------------  MAKE SURE 'OVSH' IS UPDATED WITH THE CORRECT DEFAULTS
      *--------------  FOR MPLTINFO-RM-STORED
               MOVE "26"                     TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (1)
               MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (1),
                                                RM-AUTO-STORED (1)
               MOVE "27"                     TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (2)
               MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (2),
                                                RM-AUTO-STORED (2) ,
               MOVE "28"                     TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (3)
               MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (3)
                                                RM-AUTO-STORED (3)
               MOVE "29"                     TO MPLTINFO-MJRGRP (4)
               MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-STORE-SW (4)
                                                RM-AUTO-STORED (4)
               PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

           IF MPLTINFO-TALLY-CLASS = "XXX"
               MOVE "N"                  TO TALLY-IND
           ELSE
           IF MPLTINFO-TALLY-CLASS NOT = SPACES
               MOVE "Y"                  TO TALLY-IND
               MOVE MPLTINFO-TALLY-CLASS TO TALLY-CLASS
           ELSE
               MOVE "101"                TO TALLY-CLASS.
           IF MPLTINFO-BATCH-ONLINE-LOCK = SPACES
               MOVE "N" TO MPLTINFO-BATCH-ONLINE-LOCK.
           IF MPLTINFO-BATCH-REPORT = SPACES
               MOVE "N" TO MPLTINFO-BATCH-REPORT.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-BATCH-ONLINE-LOCK TO LOCK-ONLINE-DOCK.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-BATCH-REPORT TO PRINT-BATCH-REPORT.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-DOCK-SPECIAL-PRINT TO DOCK-SPECIAL-PRINT.
      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           START MPLTINFO-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

      ***************************************************************
      **                                                           **
      **           P E R F O R M E D   R O U T I N E S             **
      **                                                           **
      ***************************************************************

       9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                   MOVE "READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 9-GET-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE "OVSH" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       9-WRITE-MPLTINFO.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "WRITE ERROR IN 9-PUT-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "OVSH" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.
           REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBUPDATE ERROR IN 9-UPDATE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "OVSH" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.
       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
